; Timer of the animated liquid tiles
;
; Counts down from 2 once per frame in #R$AE20; when it reaches zero it is reloaded with 2 and the cells of the bottom
; tile row (row 21 of the tile map) that hold tile $3B or $3C are swapped ($3B to $3C and back) and marked for redraw:
; the liquid at the foot of the room flickers every other frame. #R$AE20 is a NOP only in the rooms whose script
; contains op $9E (rooms 21, 22 and 23); everywhere else it starts with a RET.
@label=LiquidAnimTimer
g$8510 DEFB $02
